# Keep the API build context small and prevent local state or credentials from
# entering an image. This is a whitelist because the repository also contains a
# full frontend dependency tree and large runtime artifact caches.
*
!Dockerfile.api
!pyproject.toml
!packages/
!packages/**
!apps/
!apps/api/
!apps/api/**
!schema/
!schema/**
!evals/
!evals/**

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
